roves and their broader impacts on stock estimates for blue carbon ecosystems","volume":"816","author":"Fest","year":"2022","journal-title":"Sci. Total. Environ."},{"key":"B24","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"3","DOI":"10.1306\/74d70646-2b21-11d7-8648000102c1865d","article-title":"Brazos river bar; a study in the significance of grain size parameters","volume":"27","author":"Folk","year":"1957","journal-title":"J. Sediment. Res."},{"key":"B25","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"505","DOI":"10.1038\/ngeo1477","article-title":"Seagrass ecosystems as a globally significant carbon stock","volume":"5","author":"Fourqurean","year":"2012","journal-title":"Nat. Geosci."},{"key":"B26","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"9751","DOI":"10.5194\/bgd-12-9751-2015","article-title":"Water quality, isoscapes and stoichioscapes of seagrasses indicate general P limitation and unique N cycling in shallow water benthos of Bermuda","volume":"12","author":"Fourqurean","year":"2015","journal-title":"Biosci. Discussions."},{"key":"B27","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1111\/gcb.70420","article-title":"Tracing blue carbon flows across diverse seascapes","volume":"31","author":"Fulton","year":"2025","journal-title":"Global Change Biol."},{"key":"B28","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"25171","DOI":"10.1038\/s41598-024-74760-3","article-title":"Carbon stocks in Norwegian eelgrass meadows across environmental gradients","volume":"14","author":"Gagnon","year":"2024","journal-title":"Sci. Rep."},{"key":"B29","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.3389\/fmars.2019.00263","article-title":"Fingerprinting blue carbon: Rationale and tools to determine the source of organic carbon in marine depositional environments","volume":"6","author":"Geraldi","year":"2019","journal-title":"Front. Mar. Sci."},{"key":"B30","first-page":"73","article-title":"Sediment core collection and extrusion","volume-title":"Tracking Environmental Change Using Lake Sediments: Basin 